    dc:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch07-01--grok>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch07-01--grok--discriminating-power> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
